     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nHi all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nthis will be interesting for many. And it&#39;s free <span>🙂 Vive la France !</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nBest regards  --  Marc</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4551...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bounce-4551...@mm.list.cornell.edu</a>&gt; on behalf of Olivier Gimenez &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">olivier...@cefe.cnrs.fr</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, February 8, 2023 21:31<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eco...@services.cnrs.fr</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">eco...@services.cnrs.fr</a>&gt;; UMR5175Allannonces &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">allan...@cefe.cnrs.fr</a>&gt;; <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cemeb...@umontpellier.fr</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cemeb...@umontpellier.fr</a>&gt;; <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">euri...@cornell.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Olivier Gimenez &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">olivier...@cefe.cnrs.fr</a>&gt;; BESNARD Aurélien &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">aurelien...@cefe.cnrs.fr</a>&gt;; Sarah Cubaynes &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sarah.c...@cefe.cnrs.fr</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Introductory workshop on quantitative methods for population dynamics in R. June 1-2, 2023.</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div name=\"x_messageBodySection\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">Introductory workshop on quantitative methods for population dynamics in R - second edition. June 1-2, 2023.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nQuantifying population dynamics is crucial for the conservation and management of animal and plant species. This workshop deals with the analysis and modelling of population dynamics. In this introductory workshop, we will cover population projection matrix\r\n models, the estimation of demographic parameters (e.g. survival, dispersal) using capture-recapture models and the estimation of population density and abundance using capture-recapture, N-mixture and distance sampling models. The format of the workshop will\r\n be a combination of lectures and practical sessions in R with packages popbio, RMark and unmarked.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe workshop is online, free of charge, and will be video recorded. You just need to register here: <a href=\"https://forms.gle/FJmhhi9aSDpKWYRHA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://forms.gle/FJmhhi9aSDpKWYRHA&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368850000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UUSO-Su7V45FfSRekQRG_\">https://forms.gle/FJmhhi9aSDpKWYRHA</a>.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nYou may have a look to the material, video recordings and FAQs from the first edition of the workshop there: <a href=\"https://oliviergimenez.github.io/popdyn-workshop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://oliviergimenez.github.io/popdyn-workshop/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368850000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2gz8xHRiJt-40UsHFaHJYL\">https://oliviergimenez.github.io/popdyn-workshop/</a>.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCheers,<br>\r\nOlivier Gimenez, Sarah Cubaynes and Aurélien Besnard.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div name=\"x_messageSignatureSection\"><br>\r\n<font color=\"#A2A2A2\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span></font><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span></span><font color=\"\"><br>\r\n</font><font color=\"#A2A2A2\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Dr Olivier Gimenez | senior scientist at CNRS | </span></span></font><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span><a href=\"https://twitter.com/oaggimenez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/oaggimenez&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368850000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-xsE2uxZRI0sV0HkwUI3p\"><font color=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">@oaggimenez</span></font></a><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><font color=\"\"></font></span><font color=\"\"></font></span><font color=\"\"><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.inee.cnrs.fr/fr/dipee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.inee.cnrs.fr/fr/dipee&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368850000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19JA0AXs3bto0foQDLv4_l\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">DiPEE</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"></span></span></font><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#A2A2A2\"> Occitanie\r\n Est | </font><a href=\"https://www.plan-actions-lynx.fr/conseil-scientifique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.plan-actions-lynx.fr/conseil-scientifique&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw22toN_EItgFa7A_Eqz1Guc\"><font color=\"\">PNA</font></a><font color=\"\"></font><font color=\"#A2A2A2\"> lynx | GdR </font><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/gdrecostat/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/gdrecostat/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24T3eqd4XZEpjse5Vd3ULK\"><font color=\"\">EcoStat</font></a><font color=\"\"></font><font color=\"#A2A2A2\"> | </font><a href=\"https://human-animal-interactions.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://human-animal-interactions.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493368851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RghALxGNRormUrdvJ73NF\"><font color=\"\">Hair</font></a><font color=\"\"></font><font color=\"#A2A2A2\"> team</font></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"></span><font color=\"\"><br>\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">olivier...@cefe.cnrs.fr</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span></span></font><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><font color=\"#A2A2A2\"> | </font><a href=\"https://oliviergimenez.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&